msgid ""
"<strong>Approved and ready to post.</strong>\n"
"                    Posting creates the native accounting entry. Review the accounting details before continuing."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Approuvé et prêt à comptabiliser.</strong>\n"
"                    L'imputation crée l'écriture comptable native. Vérifiez les détails comptables avant de continuer."

#. module: rebuild_account_migration
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:rebuild_account_migration.view_rebuild_accounting_expense_form_guidance
